{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-146-1","title":"Psalms 146:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The Psalmist vows perpetual praises to God. 3 He exhorts not to trust in man. 5 God, for his power, justice, mercy, and kingdom, is only worthy to be trusted.</p>\n<p>A.M. 3489. B.C. 515. Praise ye the Lord. Heb. Hallelujah. 105:45 Praise the Lord. 103:1,22; 104:1,35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-2","title":"Psalms 146:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>While I live. 63:4; 71:14,15; 104:33; 145:1,2; Re 7:9-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-3","title":"Psalms 146:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Put. 62:9; 118:8,9; Isa 2:22; 31:3; 37:6; Jer 17:5,6 help. or, salvation.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-4","title":"Psalms 146:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>His breath. 104:29; Ge 2:7; 6:17; Job 14:10; 17:1; 27:3; Da 5:23 he returneth. 90:3; Ge 3:19; Ec 12:7 his thoughts. Job 14:21; 17:11; Isa 2:22; La 4:20; 1Co 2:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-5","title":"Psalms 146:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Happy. 33:12; 84:12; 144:15; De 33:29 the God. 46:7,11; 84:8; Ge 32:24-29; 50:17; Ex 3:6 whose. 39:7; 71:5; Jer 17:7,8; 1Pe 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-6","title":"Psalms 146:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>made heaven. 33:6; 136:5,6; 148:5,6; Ge 1:1; Jer 10:11,12; 32:17; Joh 1:3 Col 1:16; Re 14:7 the sea. 95:5; Ex 20:11; Job 38:8-11; Pr 8:28,29 keepeth truth. 89:2,33; 98:3; 100:5; De 7:9; Da 9:4; Mic 7:20; Joh 10:34; Tit 1:2 Heb 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-7","title":"Psalms 146:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>executeth. 9:16; 10:14,15,18; 12:5; 72:4; 103:6; Pr 22:22,23; 23:10,11; Isa 9:4 Mal 3:5 which giveth food. 107:9; 136:25; 145:15,16; Jer 31:14; Lu 1:53; 9:17 looseth. 68:6; 105:17-20; 107:10,14-16; 142:7; Isa 61:1; Zec 9:11,12 Lu 4:18; Ac 5:19; 16:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-8","title":"Psalms 146:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>openeth. Isa 35:5; 42:16,18; Mt 9:30; 11:5; Lu 18:41,42; Joh 9:7-33 Ac 26:18; Eph 1:18; 1Pe 2:9 raiseth. 145:14; 147:6; Lu 13:11-13; 2Co 7:6 loveth. 11:7; De 33:3; Joh 14:21-23; 16:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-9","title":"Psalms 146:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>preserveth. 68:5; De 10:18,19; 16:11; Pr 15:25; Jer 49:11; Ho 14:3; Mal 3:5 Jas 1:27 the way. 18:26; 83:13-17; 145:20; 147:6; 2Sa 15:31; 17:23; Es 5:14; 7:10 Es 9:25; Pr 4:19; Job 5:12-14; 1Co 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-146-10","title":"Psalms 146:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":146,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":146,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>reign. 10:16; 145:13; Ex 15:18; Isa 9:7; Da 2:44; 6:26; 7:14; Re 11:15 thy God. 147:12; Isa 12:6; 40:9; 52:7; Joe 3:17</p>"}]}